join Petrus (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Petrus (Warm)
Petrus: Hm. There it is.
- You knew it was there
	Hope: You knew it was there.
	Petrus: I hoped it was there.
	Petrus: Thirty-one years I've moved that tarpaulin out of the way to get to other things. Wife's asked me every one of those years why I keep it.
	Petrus: Tell Mkhize it wants soaking in oil for a week before he touches it with a wire brush. He won't listen. Tell him anyway.
[signal arg="hearts:petrus:2"]
set {GameState.quest_petrus_mill_stash} = "complete"
